# No ellipsis in UI copy

Never use an ellipsis (… or ...) in user-facing text: buttons, menu items, dialog titles, busy states, or status messages. This applies in the renderer and the main process (app menu, tray menu, sync status).

```
❌ "Export files…"   ✅ "Export files"
❌ "Tagging…"        ✅ "Tagging"
❌ "Syncing…"        ✅ "Syncing"
```

Allowed uses:

- Search input placeholders, which are always exactly "Search…". Never name the target ("Search tags…"); put that in `aria-label` instead
- Truncating long user content, like a clipped description or chart label: `${label.slice(0, 8)}…`
